//! Cursor glyphs generated by nibcraft (https://github.com/bobtherobot/nibcraft) from
//! original cursor designs. [`GENERATED`] says which cursors use them; the rest keep their hand-drawn
//! glyph in the parent module, or borrow another cursor's ([`Cursor::stand_in`]).
//! `cargo xtask cursors PATH/TO/NIBCRAFT` writes the `GENERATED` table and the generated `const`s,
//! by cursor id, for the cursors `crates/tools/src/cursors.toml` lists: don't edit them by hand.

